  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55427fedbef023bf52d8e045e6d39e616a56caa8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>Reflectify RT 旨在透過先進的反射技術與電影級光影，全面提升您的視覺體驗。它專注於表面與水體如何與世界互動，將您的遊戲過程轉化為生動逼真的體驗，且不會帶來不必要的複雜性。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3050ac158ae37f3e100a717b4b08ff40cbcf268.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f46728b8e38f65f4622bbc51d97f336c04bd322.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eaac91e36be8ee2df4c026f0a47680db94274253.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/be7afea7162e8d87beeb2ececc9323447cbb364e.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/791f6262853215e5e3f9555530ea00b1956839c8.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24ac310d8e9286d4533bd94dd2210531027c81ce.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/769a4bd0e3ac1d8141e6b4b0a87d0ad95abceebd.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/37c7ebdd84639a737a34d329718963ba8701fba7.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52a639e06f8b65a1a71e7d05e86e1bc17d49e2db.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e4e67587f8d391062f4540a687cf8ef07d028f0b.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2a3f0b2a39d7f1e48838deb77a5c27f6d313c4d5.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db65dc1f6c164739ddd718be1d1bf5101125a45c.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8291b53602fa07f0c7e77f6694b0244cd5e642.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>💧&nbsp;<strong>SSR 反射</strong>：冰面與平滑表面上高品質的反射效果。</p>\n<p>🌧️&nbsp;<strong>潮濕效果</strong>：降雨時出現的地面真實反射。</p>\n<p>🌊&nbsp;<strong>水下環境</strong>：清澈見底的水體，搭配自然的光線散射與扭曲效果。</p>\n<p>☀️&nbsp;<strong>上帝光柱</strong>：穿透樹木與建築物的柔和暖色光束。</p>\n<p>🌿&nbsp;<strong>自然風動</strong>：葉片、草地與植物流暢的搖曳動畫。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f4b99cb12ffebbfba90135d4c0c41d6657ce21e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>您可以在設定中輕鬆切換功能或調整反射強度，自由客製化您的遊戲體驗。此光影模組經過高度最佳化，即使在 GT 1030 等低階硬體上也能流暢運行。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a37b8ef759c70f7ba2f523f879cff996444907a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p><strong>開發者</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fin2bubble\" rel=\"nofollow\">in2bubble</a></p>\n<p><strong>授權條款</strong>: 版權所有</p>",
